   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal Resources Found-02 - LRF 2003-05</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to LRF for 2002. The main objective is to increase access to justice for the underpriviliges. During 2002 LRF will have set up legal advice offices in each province and try to handle 30 000 day-to-day legal cases.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Organisationsst&#xf6;d till Legal Resources Foundation. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka tillg&#xe5;ngen till r&#xe4;ttsv&#xe4;sendet f&#xf6;r de fattiga. Under 2002 kommer LRF att ha juridiska r&#xe5;dgivningskontor i samtliga 9 provinser och f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;ka behandla ca 30 000 enskilda vardagsjuridiska fall.</narrative>
  </description>
